g-icon lucide-pencil\"><path d=\"M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z\"></path><path d=\"m15 5 4 4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Post-test</div></div><div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">Before (90%)<br>\nAdd both top and bottom numbers: 2/5.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After (70%)<br>\nRewrite both fractions with a common denominator, then add the numerators.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Correct (self_reported)</p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"embed-actions\"><div class=\"embed-action edit-block-button\" aria-label=\"Edit this block\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-code-2\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class=\"cm-line\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div class=\"cm-embed-block cm-callout\" tabindex=\"-1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"markdown-rendered show-indentation-guide\"><div class=\"callout\" data-callout=\"cl-card\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout-metadata=\"\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-pencil\"><path d=\"M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z\"></path><path d=\"m15 5 4 4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">docs-card | due: 2026-11-19 | state: new | S: 0 | D: 0 | reps: 0 | lapses: 0 | created: 2026-11-19 | last_review:  | elapsed_days: 0 | scheduled_days: 0</div></div><div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q:</strong> How do you add two fractions with different denominators?<br>\n<strong>A:</strong> Rewrite both fractions with a common denominator, then add the numerators.</p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"embed-actions\"><div class=\"embed-action edit-block-button\" aria-label=\"Edit this block\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-code-2\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class=\"cm-line\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div class=\"cm-embed-block cm-callout\" tabindex=\"-1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><div class=\"markdown-rendered show-indentation-guide\"><div class=\"callout\" data-callout=\"cl-teach\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout-metadata=\"\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-pencil\"><path d=\"M21.174 6.812a1 1 0 0 0-3.986-3.987L3.842 16.174a2 2 0 0 0-.5.83l-1.321 4.352a.5.5 0 0 0 .623.622l4.353-1.32a2 2 0 0 0 .83-.497z\"></path><path d=\"m15 5 4 4\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">Worked example</div></div><div class=\"callout-content\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">independent_problem: How would you add 2/3 and 1/4?<br>\nFind a common denominator: 6.<br>\nRewrite 1/2 as 3/6 and 1/3 as 2/6.<br>\nAdd the numerators to get 5/6.</p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"embed-actions\"><div class=\"embed-action edit-block-button\" aria-label=\"Edit this block\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"